<DocsLayout title={title}>
<h1>progrok chat</h1>
<p>Launch the local web app at <code>http://127.0.0.1:18646</code>. The same origin serves the HTTP proxy under <code>/v1/*</code>.</p>
<pre><code>{`progrok chat
progrok chat --host 127.0.0.1 --port 18646`}</code></pre>
<p>The app supports text Responses SSE, sessions, model switching, reasoning/tool result rendering, media workflows, streaming STT, and realtime Voice. Voice sockets connect directly to xAI after the app mints a fresh one-use client secret for every realtime or STT connection.</p>
<p>OAuth access and refresh tokens stay on the server. They are not serialized into HTML, JavaScript, browser storage, or logs.</p>
</DocsLayout>
